OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,4,Acharged with GBH
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,7,Fhas been charged with causing grievous
OL,8,Fbodily harm after an alleged attack on
OL,9,Fa night concierge at a luxury
OL,10,FManchester apartment building.
OL,12,FSmith, who held the WBO
OL,13,Flight-middleweight title from 2015 to
OL,14,F2016, was arrested after the man
OL,15,Fsuffered serious facial injuries at The
OL,16,FBlade on Silvercroft Street in
OL,17,FDeansgate on 13 September, police
OL,18,Fconfirmed.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
