OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,4,Acharged with GBH
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 38-year-old appeared at Manchester
OL,7,FMagistrates Court the following day
OL,8,Fcharged with causing GBH with intent,
OL,9,Fand was released on bail.
OL,11,FSmith, from Liverpool, is next due to
OL,12,Fappear at Manchester Crown Court on 19
OL,13,FOctober, where he will be asked to
OL,14,Fenter a plea.
